<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f5f5f5; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 30px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
        .header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2); padding: 30px; text-align: center; color: white; }
        .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }
        .body { padding: 30px; }
        .credentials-box { background: #f0f4ff; border: 1px solid #c7d2fe; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px; margin: 20px 0; }
        .credentials-box p { margin: 6px 0; font-size: 14px; }
        .credentials-box strong { color: #4338ca; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; background: #667eea; color: white !important; padding: 12px 28px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; }
        .footer { padding: 20px 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #888; border-top: 1px solid #eee; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>🎉 Welcome to the Bootcamp!</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
            <p>Hi <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
            <p>You have been successfully enrolled in the <strong>{{bootcampName}}</strong> bootcamp. Your account is now active and ready to use.</p>

            <p><strong>Your Domain:</strong> {{domainName}}</p>

            <p>Here are your login credentials:</p>
            <div class="credentials-box">
                <p>📧 <strong>Email:</strong> {{email}}</p>
                <p>🔑 <strong>Password:</strong> {{password}}</p>
            </div>

            <p>Please log in and change your password as soon as possible.</p>

            <a href="{{loginLink}}" class="btn">Login to Dashboard</a>

            <p style="margin-top:24px;">You can now:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Submit your Daily Progress / Standup reports</li>
                <li>View and complete pending assignments</li>
                <li>Track your performance analytics</li>
            </ul>

            <p>Welcome aboard! 🚀</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated message from the Bootcamp Management System. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>